#This is a sample file distributed with Galaxy that is used to define litellm
#models, using 7 columns tab separated
#(longer whitespace are TAB characters):
#
#<value>	<model_id>	<name>	<domain>	<provider>	<free_tag>	<max_context>
#
#value: Unique identifier for the dropdown selection
#model_id: The actual model identifier to send to the LiteLLM API
#name: Display name shown to users in the Galaxy interface
#domain: Model type - text, image, or multimodal
#provider: Server identifier matching a key in the servers section of your YAML config
#free_tag: Optional tag that can be freely used by admins to specify additional filter options
#max_context: The model's full context window in tokens (e.g. 128000). Leave empty or 0
#             if unknown; the LLM Hub tool then skips its input-overflow check for this model.
#
#Note: this table replaces the former 6-column "genai_models" table, which had no
#max_context column. The table was renamed rather than extended in place so that
#existing genai_models.loc deployments keep working untouched: a 7-column <columns>
#declaration against a 6-field row makes Galaxy reject the entire row, and a 6-column
#declaration against a 7-field row makes the LLM Hub tool form fail to render. Admins
#migrating from genai_models should copy their rows here and append the max_context
#field (an empty 7th field is valid and simply disables the check for that row).
#
#Examples:
#
#
#gpt-oss-20b	gpt-oss-20b-llmlb	GPT-OSS Local (20B)	text	uni-freiburg	openai	128000
#gpt-oss-120b	gpt-oss-120b-llmlb	GPT-OSS Pro (120B)	text	uni-freiburg	openai	128000
#deepseek-qwen-8b	deepseek-r1-0528-qwen3-8b-llmlb	DeepSeek Qwen Chat (8B)	text	uni-freiburg	deepseek	131072
#gemma-3-12b-freiburg	gemma-3-12b-llmlb	Gemma 3 (12B) - Freiburg	multimodal	uni-freiburg	google	128000
#gemma-3-12b-custom	gemma-3-12b-llmlb	Gemma 3 (12B) - Custom	multimodal	custom-server	google	128000
#llama-3.1-8b	llama-3.1-8b-fp8-llmlb	LLaMA 3.1 (8B)	text	uni-freiburg	meta	131072
#qwen2.5-vl-7b	qwen2.5-vl-7b-llmlb	Qwen 2.5 VL (7B)	multimodal	uni-freiburg	alibaba	131072
#
#Note: The same model (same model_id) can be provided by different servers by using
#different value identifiers and provider fields. See gemma-3-12b examples above.